SUMMARY:Kitty Kat Ball
DESCRIPTION:Kitty Kat Ball is a purr-fectly fierce drag extravaganza starring RuPaul’s Drag Race’s Nini Coco\, Darlene Mitchell\, Juicy Love Dion\, and Myki Meeks. Hosted by All Stars winner\, Angeria Paris VanMichaels. Expect a gag-worthy evening of lip-syncs\, couture\, comedy\, and drag. It’s glam\, it’s camp\, and it’s giving nonstop meow-ment after meow-ment! Featuring music by Drag DJ\, CakePop! and local legends\, Kharisma + Boujee Cherry. \nLineups subject to change. No refunds.
URL:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/events/276109-kitty-kat-ball/
CATEGORIES:May
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/KittyKatBallSpring26-BfGlu9.jpg
