SUMMARY:Dance Through the Decades
DESCRIPTION:Dance Through the Decades with 97.1 Charlie FM\, and experience all the dance hits from the 70’s to the 00’s!  \nEvery hour DJ Gregarious plays a block of your favorite dance hits and VJ Disorder plays the best music videos & visuals from each decade\, including a defining dance from that decade! Dress up and represent your favorite decade! Dance an entire lifetime… in one night! Tickets are only $10 and this is a 21 and over event. \n8pm: 1970’s 9pm: 1980’s10pm: 1990’s11pm: 2000’s \nEvent has a just-for-fun Passport stamp available
